 "answer": "[ESCALATED-PRIORITY]\nCD-12013: Customer Inquiry\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your account lockout issue. As per our system records, the temporary lock duration is 15 minutes. To regain access, please follow these steps:\n\n1. **Stop Attempting to Log In**: Ensure no further login attempts are being made.\n2. **Wait 15 Minutes**: Allow the lockout period to expire.\n3. **Verify Email Address**: Confirm you are using the correct email address associated with your account.\n4. **Check Password**: Ensure you are using the most recent password.\n5. **Try Logging In Again**: Once the 15-minute window expires, attempt to log in once more.\n\nPlease proceed with these steps to unlock your account. If you encounter any",
